#: src/cli/CommandsPreflight.cpp:731
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:shell one line of the command list, keep the columns lined up"
msgid "  preflight limitations               What this check cannot see"
msgstr ""
"  preflight limitations               Ce que cette vérification ne peut "
"pas voir"

