#: src/ui/FormDesignOverlay.cpp:448
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info why no field can be added to this document"
msgid ""
"This document carries an XFA form, which is a second and incompatible "
"description of the same fields. Nothing can be added to it or changed in "
"it here, because the result would behave differently in every reader."
msgstr ""
"Ce document contient un formulaire XFA, c'est-à-dire une seconde "
"description, incompatible, des mêmes champs. Rien ne peut y être ajouté "
"ni modifié ici, car le résultat se comporterait différemment dans chaque "
"lecteur."

#: src/ui/FormDesignOverlay.cpp:456
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info a field whose box the engine will not move"
msgid ""
"One field has more than one button sharing its name, and such a field "
"keeps the places its author gave it. Its box cannot be moved or resized "
"from here."
msgid_plural ""
"%1 fields have more than one button sharing their name, and such a field "
"keeps the places its author gave it. Their boxes cannot be moved or "
"resized from here."
msgstr[0] ""
"Un champ a plusieurs boutons qui partagent son nom, et un tel champ "
"conserve les emplacements que son auteur lui a donnés. Son cadre ne peut "
"être ni déplacé ni redimensionné depuis cet endroit."
msgstr[1] ""
"%1 champs ont plusieurs boutons qui partagent leur nom, et un tel champ "
"conserve les emplacements que son auteur lui a donnés. Leurs cadres ne "
"peuvent être ni déplacés ni redimensionnés depuis cet endroit."

