#: src/ui/ObjectOverlay.cpp:2512
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info why an inline picture cannot be copied"
msgid ""
"An inline picture cannot be copied: its pixels are written into the "
"page's own instructions rather than into an object that can be lifted out "
